# sha256 of every version of each retired 1.x/2.x devkit file, from the repo's own history
# (git log --all, every commit that touched the file). install-global.sh moves a retired-name
# file out of ~/.claude/ only when its bytes match one of these lines; anything else is the
# user's and is kept. Key: agents/<name>.md · hooks/<name> · skills/<name> (its SKILL.md, also
# matched against a stale flat skills/<name>.md). Generated once; 3.x ships none of these files.
